1
00:00:00,648 --> 00:00:02,918
(Spock(on screen):)Because she feels. I don't.

2
00:00:02,917 --> 00:00:04,447
(Spock(on screen):)All I know is logic.

3
00:00:04,452 --> 00:00:06,152
(scoffs):
Yeah, right.

4
00:00:06,154 --> 00:00:07,324
(turns off TV)

5
00:00:07,322 --> 00:00:09,122
(Sheldon:)You can just shut
your feelings off.

6
00:00:09,124 --> 00:00:11,494
(Sheldon:)There goes television,
lying to us again.

7
00:00:11,493 --> 00:00:12,693
(Sheldon:)We let you

8
00:00:12,694 --> 00:00:13,794
(Sheldon:)raise our children,

9
00:00:13,795 --> 00:00:15,825
(Sheldon:)and this is the thanks we get.

10
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:18,300
(Sheldon:)Leonard, how could I
have been so foolish

11
00:00:18,299 --> 00:00:20,429
(Sheldon:)to try and follow
in the footsteps

12
00:00:20,435 --> 00:00:23,305
(Sheldon:)of a made-up alien race
with no emotions?

13
00:00:23,304 --> 00:00:24,874
(sighs):
Well...

14
00:00:24,873 --> 00:00:26,873
(Leonard:)now instead of idolizing
fictional characters,

15
00:00:26,875 --> 00:00:30,845
(Leonard:)you can focus on the real people
who are already in your life.

16
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:34,680
(Sheldon:)Those are very wise words.

17
00:00:34,682 --> 00:00:35,882
(Leonard:)Thank you.

18
00:00:35,884 --> 00:00:37,284
(Sheldon:)They'd just be
so much more comforting

19
00:00:37,285 --> 00:00:39,025
(Sheldon:)if they came
out of a television.

